    "D-CURSOR-1",
    "CUR-EDIT"
  ],
  "description": "G has T required, U with rule <>'bad' and a unique index, and table rule [N] < 1000. Sequence 1 on a dynaset with held Fields: AddNew, set U 'bad', read U and EditMode; Update (T unset and U bad), Errors, EditMode; set T 't'; Update, Errors; set U 'u1' (duplicate); Update, Errors; set U 'u9' and N 2000; Update, Errors; set N 3; Update, Errors, read ID. Sequences 2 and 3 on fresh dynasets: AddNew, then U 'bad' and T Null, or T Null and U 'bad'; Update, Errors, CancelUpdate. Sequence 4: set the recordset Field U ValidateOnSet True, Edit, set U 'bad', Errors, EditMode, CancelUpdate. Asks the check order, which check runs at assignment and which at Update. The fixture copy is opened read-write.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
  "observationRecipe": [
    "clearErrorInfoBefore",
    "excepinfo",
    "deferredFill",
    "errorInfo"
  ],
